[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631625906","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99715#issuecomment-2631625906","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99715","id":2631625906,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c22yy","user":{"login":"SleepProgger","id":1274039,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzQwMzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1274039?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepProgger","html_url":"https://github.com/SleepProgger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepProgger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepProgger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepProgger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepProgger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepProgger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepProgger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepProgger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepProgger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepProgger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T17:27:02Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T17:27:02Z","body":"Can confirm this with another example.\nI have a SubViewportContainer and the inner SubViewport has its background set to transparent.\nThe parent of the viewport has a white background.\nDrawing a white line inside the viewport results in this noticeable outline artifact:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b53dc0e3-169d-4801-bd25-b3646d922b1e)\n\nbut when unpremultiplying the texture in the SubViewportContainer shader like this:\n```\nvoid fragment() {\n\tvec4 txt = texture(TEXTURE, UV);\n   \tvec3 unpremultiplied_rgb = txt.a > 0.0 \n    \t? txt.rgb / txt.a \n    \t: txt.rgb;\n\tCOLOR.rgb = unpremultiplied_rgb.rgb;\n\tCOLOR.a = txt.a;\n}\n```\n\n... the result is a white image without the artifacts as expected.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631625906/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2649597447","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99715#issuecomment-2649597447","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99715","id":2649597447,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d7aYH","user":{"login":"deertwoheads","id":9205081,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyMDUwODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9205081?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deertwoheads","html_url":"https://github.com/deertwoheads","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deertwoheads/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deertwoheads/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deertwoheads/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deertwoheads/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deertwoheads/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deertwoheads/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deertwoheads/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deertwoheads/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deertwoheads/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T01:09:46Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T01:09:46Z","body":"I am also having this issue on v4.2.2.stable.official [15073afe3]. I am handling images with a lot of intermediate transparency, so the premultiplication artifacts are easy to see.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7718102b-5a21-4c61-8688-93f8d063e5c4)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2649597447/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2687479302","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99715#issuecomment-2687479302","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99715","id":2687479302,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gL64G","user":{"login":"vyshliy","id":72736632,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzM2NjMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72736632?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vyshliy","html_url":"https://github.com/vyshliy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vyshliy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vyshliy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vyshliy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vyshliy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vyshliy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vyshliy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vyshliy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vyshliy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vyshliy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T10:08:39Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T10:13:01Z","body":"Can confirm in 4.4 beta 4.\n\nAlpha 50%:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0071d58b-8322-4fd6-9c99-031c85229e75)\n\nAlpha 100%, semi-transparent edges still multiplied\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7100932b-31be-479e-9a28-a30e65e45c4d)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2687479302/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3182018345","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99715#issuecomment-3182018345","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99715","id":3182018345,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69qb8p","user":{"login":"drepetto","id":1171319,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzEzMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1171319?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/drepetto","html_url":"https://github.com/drepetto","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drepetto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drepetto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drepetto/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drepetto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drepetto/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drepetto/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drepetto/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drepetto/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/drepetto/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-13T02:58:54Z","updated_at":"2025-08-13T02:58:54Z","body":"I'm seeing the same thing in 4.5 beta5. \n\nAs @lostminds suggested, adding a material with Premultiplied Alpha does fix the issue. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3182018345/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/331954552